{"unit_id":"tag:03YC:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节讨论平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）的概念，其对象为代数空间（algebraic spaces），并定义大平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）位点（site），其对象为一个代数空间（algebraic space）。请与《拓扑（Topologies）》第<REF_0001>节比较。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"所定义的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"代数空间的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖的对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"所定义的位点；待批准。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"大平展位点；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"位点对应的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"章节标题；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041E:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。所谓<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平展覆盖（<ACCENT_0001>tale covering），覆盖空间<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0005>，由<MATH_0006>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）之间的态射组成，满足每个<MATH_0007>都是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）的，并且\n<MATH_0008>\n即这些态射（morphisms）联合为满射（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale covering","target_term":"平展覆盖"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale covering","target_term":"平展覆盖","context":"本定义的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"覆盖中的态射族；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖的源与目标；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖态射的性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖的各态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"联合满射性；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YC:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这与《拓扑（Topologies）》定义<REF_0001>完全相同。特别地，如果<MATH_0001>及所有<MATH_0002>都是概形（schemes），则恢复了通常的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）概念，其对象为概形（schemes）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"章节标题；待批准。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"恢复通常定义的情形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"通常的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"概形的平展覆盖；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DF1:statement","translation":"任意 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）都是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"引理的假设；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"引理的结论；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"引理的结论；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DF1:proof","translation":"这由定义及开浸入（open immersion）是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）这一事实可知（这一事实由《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>借助《代数空间》引理<REF_0002>推出，因为浸入（immersions）是可表示（representable）的）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"immersions","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表示"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"所用的态射性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"开浸入的性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"开浸入是平展态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"章节标题；待批准。"},{"source_term":"immersions","target_term":"浸入","context":"可表示的态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表示","context":"浸入的性质；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041F:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>若<MATH_0004>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0005>是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering），覆盖<MATH_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0003>若<MATH_0007>是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）覆盖（covering），并且对每个<MATH_0008>都有一个平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009>，则<MATH_0010>是平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004>若<MATH_0011>是平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）覆盖（covering），且<MATH_0012>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0013>是平展（<ACCENT_0006>tale）覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0004>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0005>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0006>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖的对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"第一个覆盖公理；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"同构给出的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖公理中的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"复合的外层覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_te